OL,3,ACyber attack on police force may have
OL,4,A'compromised' staff information
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force in Wales has been hit by
OL,7,Fa cyber attack which may have resulted
OL,8,Fin staff information being "accessed or
OL,9,Fcompromised".
OL,11,FDyfed-Powys Police said the incident
OL,12,Fhad caused disruption to some
OL,13,Fnon-emergency systems but no personal
OL,14,Fdata relating to members of the public
OL,15,Fwas believed to have been accessed.
OL,17,FThe force said the incident was
OL,18,Fidentified on 14 September, and an
OL,19,Finvestigation had been going on into
OL,20,Fthe circumstances surrounding it.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
